.com/watch/video/san-antonio-spurs-vs-minnesota-timberwolves-2nd-half-highlights-5?plsrc=nba\u0026game-highlights=0022600152","videoDuration":"01:29","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2026/10/b0790d89-b4ed-4603-a649-7583e53f7b3d_0-1.jpg","entitlements":"free","videoFranchisesName":{"individual-top-plays-wsc":"Individual Top Plays WSC"}},{"id":2413772,"title":"San Antonio Spurs vs. Minnesota Timberwolves - 4th Quarter Highlights","shortTitle":"","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/watch/video/san-antonio-spurs-vs-minnesota-timberwolves-4th-quarter-highlights-5?plsrc=nba\u0026game-highlights=0022600152","videoDuration":"01:24","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2026/10/b0790d89-b4ed-4603-a649-7583e53f7b3d_0.jpg","entitlements":"free","videoFranchisesName":{"individual-top-plays-wsc":"Individual Top Plays WSC"}},{"id":2413768,"title":"Jonathan Kuminga rises up for the dunk","shortTitle":"","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/watch/video/jonathan-kuminga-rises-up-for-the-dunk-10?plsrc=nba\u0026game-highlights=0022600152","videoDuration":"00:17","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2026/10/229f993b-d487-4989-9f6d-a50427bdc925_0-1.jpg","entitlements":"","videoFranchisesName":{"4-to-5-stars":"Rated Plays"}},{"id":2413751,"title":"Jonathan Kuminga throws it down","shortTitle":"","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/watch/video/jonathan-kuminga-throws-it-down-9?plsrc=nba\u0026game-highlights=0022600152","videoDuration":"00:17","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2026/10/229f993b-d487-4989-9f6d-a50427bdc925_0.jpg","entitlements":"free","videoFranchisesName":{"individual-top-plays-wsc":"Individual Top Plays WSC"}},{"id":2413722,"title":"Dunk by Victor Wembanyama","shortTitle":"","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/watch/video/dunk-by-victor-wembanyama-62?plsrc=nba\u0026game-highlights=0022600152","videoDuration":"00:21","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2026/10/fa3d547d-08b3-4851-9914-371a869d7dc3_0.jpg","entitlements":"free","videoFranchisesName